Yes, the two eggs you keep in your inventory will let you know when the
other ones are ready to stack.

Also, basilisks are cool pets for a monk, since you won't want to eat
corpses. They will make a lot of statues that can be cracked open for
unused inventory.

When you wield a stack of eggs, the eggs will all go 'splat' together
if you hit something, so you should wield eggs only one at a time.

Every time you break an egg that you laid yourself, you get -1 to luck.
 If you throw the egg, you may end up wasting several, and bad luck
reduces your chances of hitting.

Crystal golems are new.  They have 300 HP and are resistant to almost
everything.


